From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herrie <Github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 17:52:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] appinfo.json: drop requiredPermissions for ACGs that do not
 exist

'settings', 'system' and 'signals.register' are legacy access control
group names; nothing in the image defines them:

WARNING: luneos-dev-image-1.0-r0 do_validate_ls2_acg: Found 17 group(s) used in client-permissions.d but not defined
'settings' being used in:
  com.webos.app.mediagallery.app.json
'signals.register' being used in:
  com.webos.app.mediagallery.app.json
'system' being used in:
  com.webos.app.mediagallery.app.json

The app only talks to com.webos.applicationManager and
com.webos.service.mediaindexer, which are covered by
application.launcher/application.operation and mediaindexer.operation,
so the three entries are dead weight and can simply go.
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 com.webos.app.mediagallery/appinfo.json | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/com.webos.app.mediagallery/appinfo.json b/com.webos.app.mediagallery/appinfo.json
index c0b9d99..ad58f92 100644
--- a/com.webos.app.mediagallery/appinfo.json
+++ b/com.webos.app.mediagallery/appinfo.json
@@ -18,5 +18,5 @@
     "spinnerOnLaunch": false,
     "transparent":false,
     "uiRevision":2,
-    "requiredPermissions": ["settings","system","signals.register","application.launcher","mediaindexer.operation","notification.operation"]
+    "requiredPermissions": ["application.launcher","mediaindexer.operation","notification.operation"]
 }
